WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Use a descriptive page title and a clear main heading.

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Keep important information in readable HTML.

3
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Build navigation from real links with meaningful labels.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Review the page on a narrow screen before publishing.
